# ---- Licensing / provenance guards ----
# Third-party source packs must not be redistributed through this public repository.
# Import them locally into Assets/ThirdParty/<Vendor>/ (ignored) and record them in Docs/AssetManifest.md.
/Assets/ThirdParty/*
!/Assets/ThirdParty/README.md
!/Assets/ThirdParty/README.md.meta
# GTA VI visual reference frames are study material only (credited to Rockstar Games); never commit them.
/Reference/
reference_images/

